            <head>Fine Knacks for Ladies</head>
            <p rend="justify">"Fine Knacks for Ladies"</p>
            <p rend="justify">Composer: John Dowland (1563-1626)</p>
            <p rend="justify">Arranger: Rick Davis</p>
            <p rend="justify">This is a song by the English lutenist and composer John Dowland. He published it in a book of songs in 1600. Rick wrote the guitar part, which is loosely based on Dowland's lute accompaniment.</p>
